{"unit_id":"lemonel__dsh-prompt-freeze#card-zh","repo":"lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze","commit":"0072914947606a843873cd8e83def468c92f6932","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Prompt Freeze（DSH 网页插件）为每个会话保存工具声明和命名 system prompt 段落快照，并在后续请求中回放。输入栏旁的面板展示工具、提示段、上下文和变量差异，用户可审阅后在 agent 空闲时应用新版本。上下文、变量和实时段落继续使用当前值。它也支持按会话设置 token 估算阈值自动应用，以及在写入结果不确定时保留快照或重新采集。需要本地存储目录，不需 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/backend/core.ts:24","src/backend/core.ts:83","src/frontend_index.ts:15","src/backend/host.ts:627"]}
{"unit_id":"lemonel__dsh-prompt-freeze#card-en","repo":"lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze","commit":"0072914947606a843873cd8e83def468c92f6932","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Prompt Freeze snapshots session tools and named system-prompt sections, then replays them. Its panel shows changes for review before applying while the agent is idle. Contexts stay current. A token threshold enables auto-apply; uncertain writes offer keep or recapture. It uses local storage.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/backend/core.ts:24","src/backend/core.ts:83","src/frontend_index.ts:15","src/backend/host.ts:627"]}
