{"unit_id":"lemonel__dsh-prompt-freeze#readme-1","repo":"lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze","commit":"0072914947606a843873cd8e83def468c92f6932","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"@lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze README · Prompt Freeze / 提示前缀冻结：冻结会话的工具声明和命名提示段落（system prompt），防止意外改动导致的缓存失效，审阅后决定是否修改。npm 包 `@lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze`，不保证缓存命中，也不阻止或限制工具执行。\n\n[English](./README.en.md)","source":"extracted","section":"Prompt Freeze / 提示前缀冻结"}
{"unit_id":"lemonel__dsh-prompt-freeze#readme-2","repo":"lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze","commit":"0072914947606a843873cd8e83def468c92f6932","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"@lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze README · 功能：- 首次真实请求建快照，之后原样回放。\n- 面板按 tools / sections / contexts / variables 列差异，点「应用此版本」才生效（需空闲）。\n- contexts、variables、`live` 段落不冻结，标「实时 · 缓存已失效」；「确认实时差异」只停止显示。\n- 自动应用：阈值按会话设（默认 24K tokens），仅下一条真实用户消息触发。\n- 写入结果不确定时停下，选保留或重建；子会话自动保留并冒泡到父面板。\n- 界面跟随 DSH locale；工具名、schema、原文不翻译。","source":"extracted","section":"功能"}
{"unit_id":"lemonel__dsh-prompt-freeze#readme-3","repo":"lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze","commit":"0072914947606a843873cd8e83def468c92f6932","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"@lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze README · 安装：DSH `0.2.0-rc.1`–`0.2.1`。\n\n一条命令安装预构建包，无需本地编译：\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add https://github.com/lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze/releases/download/v1.0.0/lemonel-dsh-prompt-freeze-1.0.0.tgz\n```\n\n将 `web` 替换为实际使用的 profile；安装后确认 bundle 已启用，重载后端并刷新页面。\n\n也可以从 [GitHub Release](https://github.com/lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze/releases/tag/v1.0.0) 下载 tgz，在 Plugins 页安装并勾选 bundle。\n\n从源码打包（在仓库根目录执行）：\n\n```sh\nnpm ci && npm pack\n```\n\n手动接入：","source":"extracted","section":"安装"}
{"unit_id":"lemonel__dsh-prompt-freeze#readme-4","repo":"lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze","commit":"0072914947606a843873cd8e83def468c92f6932","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"@lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze README · 安装：```yaml\n- id: prompt-freeze\n  name: '@lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze'\n  config:\n    directory: /absolute/private/path/prompt-freeze\n\n`directory` 默认 `<profile 目录>/cache-guard/<profile 身份哈希>`；`autoApplyBelow` 支持 K/M（K=1000），留空关闭。装完重载后端、刷新页面。","source":"extracted","section":"安装"}
{"unit_id":"lemonel__dsh-prompt-freeze#readme-5","repo":"lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze","commit":"0072914947606a843873cd8e83def468c92f6932","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"@lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze README · 使用：入口在输入栏左侧，点击「Prompt Freeze」：\n\n1. 眼睛按钮看差异。\n2. 有差异：重新审阅最新版本 → 应用此版本。\n3. 仅实时内容变化：确认实时差异。\n\n不开自动应用时，不点即沿用活动版本。","source":"extracted","section":"使用"}
{"unit_id":"lemonel__dsh-prompt-freeze#readme-6","repo":"lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze","commit":"0072914947606a843873cd8e83def468c92f6932","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"@lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze README · 数据与边界：- 状态在 `<profile 目录>/cache-guard/<身份哈希>/`：会话 manifest + `payload-<sha256>.json`；文件 0600，目录 0700。\n- 单进程独占，无跨进程锁。\n- payload 不回收，目录只增。\n- 不承诺缓存命中或计费；模型变化、compact、上游过期仍会失效。\n- 外层 assembly 可在快照外追加工具，最终请求可能与快照不一致。\n- 历史兼容：`source.kind=prompt-freeze`，仍接受 `cache-guard`、`tool-declaration-snapshot`；存储目录沿用 `cache-guard`。","source":"extracted","section":"数据与边界"}
{"unit_id":"lemonel__dsh-prompt-freeze#readme-7","repo":"lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze","commit":"0072914947606a843873cd8e83def468c92f6932","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"@lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze README · 兼容性：| DSH | 结果 |\n| --- | --- |\n| `0.2.0-rc.1` / `0.2.0-rc.2` | 通过 |\n| `0.2.1-alpha.4` | 通过（上游移除 `both` 模式） |\n\n`@deepseek-ai/*` 为 `peerDependencies` 且带预发布区间；越界版本启动时禁用插件。","source":"extracted","section":"兼容性"}
{"unit_id":"lemonel__dsh-prompt-freeze#readme-8","repo":"lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze","commit":"0072914947606a843873cd8e83def468c92f6932","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"@lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze README · 开发：```sh\nnpm install && npm run typecheck && npm test\n```\n\n源码使用普通 TS（strict）：入口为 `src/backend_index.ts` 和 `src/frontend_index.ts`，实现分别放在 `src/backend/` 与 `src/frontend/`，`src/shared/` 为两端共用的 RPC 契约；`npm run build` 生成 `lib/`。`lib/` 不提交、不手改，本地链接安装前先构建。","source":"extracted","section":"开发"}
{"unit_id":"lemonel__dsh-prompt-freeze#readme-9","repo":"lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze","commit":"0072914947606a843873cd8e83def468c92f6932","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"@lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze README · Prompt Freeze：Freezes a session's tool declarations and named prompt sections (system prompt) to prevent cache invalidation caused by unintended changes; review before deciding whether to apply changes. npm package `@lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze`. No cache-hit guarantee, and it never blocks or restricts tools.\n\n[中文](./README.md)","source":"extracted","section":"Prompt Freeze"}
{"unit_id":"lemonel__dsh-prompt-freeze#readme-10","repo":"lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze","commit":"0072914947606a843873cd8e83def468c92f6932","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"@lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze README · Features：- Snapshot on the first real request, replayed verbatim afterwards.\n- Panel diffs per tools / sections / contexts / variables; nothing changes until *Apply this version* (idle agent required).\n- Contexts, variables and `live` sections are not frozen and show as \"Live · cache invalidated\"; *Acknowledge live differences* only stops showing them.\n- Auto-apply: per-session threshold (default 24K tokens), checked only on the next genuine user message.\n- Unknown write outcome stops the session: keep or recapture. Delegated sessions keep automatically and report to the parent panel.\n- UI follows the DSH locale service; tool names, schemas and source text are not translated.","source":"extracted","section":"Features"}
{"unit_id":"lemonel__dsh-prompt-freeze#readme-11","repo":"lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze","commit":"0072914947606a843873cd8e83def468c92f6932","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"@lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze README · Install：DSH `0.2.0-rc.1`–`0.2.1`.\n\nInstall the prebuilt package with one command; no local build is required:\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add https://github.com/lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze/releases/download/v1.0.0/lemonel-dsh-prompt-freeze-1.0.0.tgz\n```\n\nReplace `web` with your profile name. After installation, confirm the bundle is enabled, reload the backend and refresh the page.","source":"extracted","section":"Install"}
{"unit_id":"lemonel__dsh-prompt-freeze#readme-12","repo":"lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze","commit":"0072914947606a843873cd8e83def468c92f6932","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"@lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze README · Install：Alternatively, download the tgz from the [GitHub Release](https://github.com/lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze/releases/tag/v1.0.0), install it from the Plugins page and select the bundle.\n\nTo build a package from source, run in the repository root:\n\n```sh\nnpm ci && npm pack\n```\n\nBy hand:\n\n```yaml\n- id: prompt-freeze\n  name: '@lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze'\n  config:\n    directory: /absolute/private/path/prompt-freeze","source":"extracted","section":"Install"}
{"unit_id":"lemonel__dsh-prompt-freeze#readme-13","repo":"lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze","commit":"0072914947606a843873cd8e83def468c92f6932","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"@lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze README · Install：`directory` defaults to `<profile dir>/cache-guard/<profile identity hash>`; `autoApplyBelow` takes K/M (K=1000), empty disables. Reload the backend and refresh after install.","source":"extracted","section":"Install"}
{"unit_id":"lemonel__dsh-prompt-freeze#readme-14","repo":"lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze","commit":"0072914947606a843873cd8e83def468c92f6932","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"@lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze README · Usage：The entry sits left of the composer; click *Prompt Freeze*:\n\n1. Eye button opens the diff.\n2. On a diff: *Review latest version* → *Apply this version*.\n3. Live-only changes: *Acknowledge live differences*.\n\nWithout auto-apply, doing nothing keeps the active version.","source":"extracted","section":"Usage"}
{"unit_id":"lemonel__dsh-prompt-freeze#readme-15","repo":"lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze","commit":"0072914947606a843873cd8e83def468c92f6932","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"@lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze README · Data and limits：- State in `<profile dir>/cache-guard/<identity hash>/`: per-session manifest + `payload-<sha256>.json`; files 0600, directories 0700.\n- One process per directory; no cross-process lock.\n- Payloads are never collected; the directory only grows.\n- No cache-hit or billing guarantee; model changes, compaction and provider expiry still invalidate.\n- An outer assembly hook can append tools after replay, so the final request may differ from the snapshot.\n- Compatibility: `source.kind=prompt-freeze`, `cache-guard` and `tool-declaration-snapshot` still accepted; storage keeps the name `cache-guard`.","source":"extracted","section":"Data and limits"}
{"unit_id":"lemonel__dsh-prompt-freeze#readme-16","repo":"lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze","commit":"0072914947606a843873cd8e83def468c92f6932","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"@lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze README · Compatibility：| DSH | Result |\n| --- | --- |\n| `0.2.0-rc.1` / `0.2.0-rc.2` | pass |\n| `0.2.1-alpha.4` | pass (upstream dropped `both`) |\n\n`@deepseek-ai/*` are `peerDependencies` with explicit prerelease ranges; an out-of-range host disables the plugin at startup.","source":"extracted","section":"Compatibility"}
{"unit_id":"lemonel__dsh-prompt-freeze#readme-17","repo":"lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze","commit":"0072914947606a843873cd8e83def468c92f6932","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"@lemonel/dsh-prompt-freeze README · Development：```sh\nnpm install && npm run typecheck && npm test\n```\n\nOrdinary TypeScript sources (strict): entries are `src/backend_index.ts` and `src/frontend_index.ts`, with implementations in `src/backend/` and `src/frontend/`, and `src/shared/` contains the shared RPC contract; `npm run build` emits `lib/`. Do not commit or edit `lib/`; build before installing a local link.","source":"extracted","section":"Development"}
